"@af6gppjuem607qnhkp473jqcea": "The same element with this id.",
"@amck076uqd9q0l2f1o4s36n26a": "A ul element with these children: a list with bullets, whose items are li.",
"@ashp4ad7f7fjrrdg0fdvgklhv5": "A strong element with these children: important text, usually bold.",
"@br778b3lcbdj210kfm5opucsd2": "An attribute whose value doesn't change.",
"@d17834edl1dk7hju3drl09n3li": "The same element in this class, for a style sheet's rules to select.",
"@ee805es9657l97itvsvh2spaam": "An element with these children, for a tag that has no function of its own here (main, nav, table, …). Each tag a function, as in Elm's Html module (prior art).",
"@fd7cm0v4u5fhdto4rl56idjv8e": "The same element with this inline style (CSS declarations, such as color: #777; margin: 0).",
"@kjtg3gup9t5rtec8u4sk11368u": "A li element with these children: one item of a list.",
"@l1ibnd69fhv5j8j3reredg1ar1": "A style sheet rule: a selector and its declarations. A style sheet is a list of these, so it shows rule by rule instead of as one long text.",
"@l3rf1umimin42d16h0r9vrvnf2": "A section element with these children: a part of the page.",
"@nubmshoo6l8uccokismj6debh9": "A label element with these children: a label for a field.",
