"@qptsgvidqc2e187508pe8t8jms": "The same element with these attributes added after its own. Text and parts have no attributes, so they come back as they are.",
"@rrc61bud51hgr319omhcik166b": "The texts with between between each two of them.",
"@thivg925mqhpcvfu7t49e85dj7": "A button with this label that runs then when it's clicked.",
"@tp2t4o5b7su3g3ufaltmo27krn": "A style element holding these rules.",
"@uku2itaq47hmq0ki20ec386h4n": "The items of a cell's list, each drawn by row and all put inside (ul, div, …). An item still there when the list changes keeps its row as it was; only new items get one. Solid's <For> (prior art).",
"@urmvgd3e2dcctt7q85g15nql15": "Rules that apply only when the query holds, such as (prefers-color-scheme: dark).",
